This directory contains OMP's IPython controller and state-snapshot behavior,
adapted from Prime Agent (https://github.com/PrimeIntellect-ai/prime-agent) at
commit 0e0d23391bcd879f1aea70dbda4d07dda7970b34, under the MIT License.

  Copyright (c) 2025 Mario Zechner
  Copyright (c) 2026 Prime Intellect

The correlated Jupyter execution, rich-output, Comm, interruption, lifecycle,
per-name dill snapshot, content-versioned uv bootstrap, callable RLM shim, and
focused Python skill contracts are adapted from Prime Agent's kernel, IPython
tool, state-snapshot, bootstrap, runtime package, and skill implementations. OMP
replaces Prime Agent's Node ZeroMQ client with a private framed-stdio Python
jupyter_client controller. Its Python ABI calls session-scoped OMP services and
does not import Prime packages, read host credential stores, or require a Prime
checkout.

